{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10102050","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10102050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1010205001:0":{"text":"ありがとう！あなたたちが助けてくれなかったら、今ごろ奴らのお腹の中でしたよ！","source_cn":"谢天谢地，要不是你们救我，我已经进了它们的肚子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97D7E26834BD7A12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010205002:0":{"text":"ま、まずは自己紹介ですね……ボクはクインです。","source_cn":"自、自我介绍一下……我叫洛桑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0937AF0A72237DD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010205003:0":{"text":"ま、待ってください、クイン様。今、危うく食べられるところだったと言いましたか？","source_cn":"等等……洛桑大人，您是说，您差点被它们吃掉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B92BF7C203D06A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010205004:0":{"text":"その通り！皮を剥ぐためのナイフも用意してましたよ！","source_cn":"千真万确！它们连剥皮的刀都磨好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB09DF71C4D4BBFA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010205005:0":{"text":"グブリンは確かに人型の肉食動物ですが、彼らは自分よりも小さい草食動物しか食べないはずです。","source_cn":"咕布林虽然是肉食性类人生物，但它们的食谱上，只有那些体...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC1CCA84A0FE0A91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl